Aim

To develop an online beauty parlour appointment booking system for booking, managing, and cancelling appointments.

Algorithm
Start the program.
Register and log in to the system.
Browse beauty services and select a stylist.
Choose the appointment date and time.
Enter customer details and confirm the booking.
Make payment and receive confirmation.
Admin manages services, staff schedules, appointments, and payments.
Stop the program.
Result

Thus, the online beauty parlour appointment booking system was designed to manage appointments, payments, cancellations, and customer feedback efficiently.
